msgid "Hotspot"
msgstr "Hotspot"

msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`sampling profiler instructions "
"<doc_sampling_profilers>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"詳情請參閱 :ref:`sampling profiler instructions <doc_sampling_profilers>` 。"

msgid ""
"Open `Hotspot <https://github.com/KDAB/hotspot>`__. Click **Record Data**:"
msgstr ""
"打開 `Hotspot <https://github.com/KDAB/hotspot>`__ 。點擊 **Record Data** ："

msgid ""
"In the next window, specify the path to the Godot binary that includes debug "
"symbols."
msgstr "在下一個視窗中，指定包含除錯符號的 Godot 執行檔路徑。"

msgid ""
"Specify command line arguments to run a specific project, with or without "
"the editor."
msgstr "可自行決定是否加入命令列參數，以選擇用編輯器或直接執行專案。"

msgid ""
"The path to the working directory can be anything if an absolute path is "
"used for the ``--path`` command line argument. Otherwise, it must be set so "
"that the relative path to the project is valid."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``--path`` 命令行參數使用的是絕對路徑，那麼工作目錄的路徑可以隨便設定"
"（填甚麼都可以）。否則（如果 --path 用的是相對路徑），工作目錄就必須設定正"
"確，以確保能根據相對路徑成功找到專案。"

msgid ""
"Make sure **Elevate Privileges** is checked if you have administrative "
"privileges. While not essential for profiling Godot, this will ensure all "
"events can be captured. Otherwise, some events may be missing from the "
"capture. Your settings should now look something like this:"
msgstr ""
"如果你有管理員權限，請確保勾選 **Elevate Privileges** （提升權限）。雖然這對"
"分析 Godot 來說不是絕對必要的，但勾選它能確保捕獲到所有的系統事件。否則，抓取"
"到的資料里可能會缺失一部分事件。現在，你的設定看起來應該差不多是這樣的："

msgid ""
"Click **Start Recording** and perform the actions you wish to profile in the "
"editor/project."
msgstr "點擊 **Start Recording**，然後在編輯器或專案中執行你要分析的操作。"

msgid ""
"Quit the editor/project normally or use the **Stop Profiling** button in "
"Hotspot to stop profiling early. Stopping profiling early can result in "
"cleaner profiles if you're not interested in the engine's shutdown procedure."
msgstr ""
"可以正常退出編輯器或專案，或者點擊 Hotspot 里的 **Stop Profiling** （停止分"
"析） 按鈕來提前結束分析。如果你對引擎的關閉流程（shutdown procedure）不感興"
"趣，提前結束分析往往能得到更乾淨、更純粹的效能分析報告。"

msgid ""
"Click **View Results** and wait for the profiling visualization to be "
"generated:"
msgstr "點選 **View Results**，等待產生視覺化的效能分析結果："

msgid ""
"Use the tabs at the top to navigate between the different views. These views "
"show the same data, but in different ways. The **Flame Graph** tab is a good "
"way to see which functions take up the most time at a glance. These "
"functions are therefore the most important ones to optimize, since "
"optimizing them will improve performance the most."
msgstr ""
"可利用上方分頁切換不同檢視模式，這些檢視僅是用不同方式展示相同資料。**Flame "
"Graph** （火焰圖）分頁能一目了然哪些函式最耗時。這些函式便是最應優化的目標，"
"因為優化它們能最有效提升效能。"

msgid ""
"At the bottom of all tabs except **Summary**, you will also see a list of "
"CPU threads started by the engine along with the CPU utilization for each "
"thread. This lets you see threads that can be a bottleneck at a given point "
"in time."
msgstr ""
"除了 **Summary** （摘要） 分頁之外，在所有其他分頁的底部，你還會看到一個由引"
"擎啟動的 CPU 執行緒清單，以及每個執行緒的 CPU 使用率。這能讓你清楚地看到，在"
"特定的時間點上，哪些執行緒可能正在成為效能瓶頸。"

msgid ""
"If you don't want the startup procedure to be included in the profile, you "
"can also attach Hotspot to a running process by clicking **Record Data** "
"then setting the **Launch Application** dropdown option to **Attach To "
"Process(es)**."
msgstr ""
"如果你不希望把程式啟動階段的過程也包含在效能分析記錄里，你還可以通過點擊 "
"**Record Data（記錄資料）** ，然後將 **Launch Application（啟動應用程式）** "
"的下拉選項設定為 **Attach To Process(es)（附加到處理程序）** ，來讓 Hotspot "
"直接連接到一個已經在執行的處理程序上。"

msgid ""
"This process attachment-based workflow is similar to the one used by "
"VerySleepy."
msgstr "這種附加程序的方式和 VerySleepy 的操作流程很像。"
